{"seq":3,"slug":"nutrient-cycling","title":"物质循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ecology/foundations/nutrient-cycling","wordCount":3142,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"物质循环\">物质循环</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>物质循环（Nutrient Cycling），又称生物地球化学循环（Biogeochemical Cycles），是指组成生物体的化学元素在生态系统的生物组分与非生物环境之间反复循环的过程。与 <a href=\"energy-flow-trophic-levels\">能量流动</a> 的单向性不同，物质循环具有<strong>周而复始</strong>的特征——元素不会被消耗殆尽，而是在不同形态和储库之间不断转化和移动。</p>\n<p>生命依赖约 20-25 种化学元素，其中碳（C）、氢（H）、氧（O）、氮（N）、磷（P）、硫（S）是构成有机分子的六大元素，占生物体干重的 95% 以上。这些元素的循环速率、瓶颈环节和人类扰动程度直接决定了生态系统的生产力和健康状况。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>物质循环研究的核心术语与要点汇总如下，后文按元素逐一展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生物地球化学循环</td>\n<td>元素在生物组分与非生物储库间反复转化与移动的过程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气体型循环</td>\n<td>主储库在大气或水圈，速度快、全球均匀（如 C、N、水循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沉积型循环</td>\n<td>主储库在岩石圈/土壤，速度慢、空间不均（如 P 循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>储库与通量</td>\n<td>元素停留的库（pool）与单位时间在库间转移的量（flux）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限制因子</td>\n<td>供应相对需求最不足、制约生产力的元素（Liebig 最小因子定律）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学计量学</td>\n<td>生物体元素比例约束循环耦合，如 Redfield 比率 C:N:P ≈ 106:16:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行星边界</td>\n<td>把人类对循环的扰动纳入全球可持续性评估的安全操作空间框架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"循环的基本类型\">循环的基本类型</h2><p>根据主要储库的位置，生物地球化学循环可分为两大类型：</p>\n<h3 id=\"气体型循环-gaseous-cycles\">气体型循环（Gaseous Cycles）</h3><p>储库主要在大气或水圈中，循环速度快，全球尺度上较为均匀：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>碳循环</strong>：CO₂ 是大气储库</li>\n<li><strong>氮循环</strong>：N₂ 是大气储库</li>\n<li><strong>水循环</strong>：大气水汽和海洋</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"沉积型循环-sedimentary-cycles\">沉积型循环（Sedimentary Cycles）</h3><p>储库主要在岩石圈和土壤中，循环速度慢，空间分布不均：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>磷循环</strong>：磷酸盐岩石</li>\n<li><strong>硫循环</strong>：兼具气体型和沉积型特征</li>\n<li><strong>铁、钙等金属元素循环</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"碳循环\">碳循环</h2><p>碳是生命的基本骨架元素，也是当前全球变化研究的核心。碳循环连接了生物过程、地质过程和人类活动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碳的储库与通量\">碳的储库与通量</h3><p>全球碳的主要储库（单位：Pg C = 10¹⁵g C）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>储库</th>\n<th>碳储量 (Pg C)</th>\n<th>周转时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大气 CO₂</td>\n<td>~880 (2024)</td>\n<td>~4 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>陆地植被</td>\n<td>~450</td>\n<td>数年-数百年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>土壤有机碳</td>\n<td>~1500-2400</td>\n<td>数十年-数千年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海洋表层</td>\n<td>~900</td>\n<td>数年-数十年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海洋深层</td>\n<td>~37,000</td>\n<td>数百年-数千年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化石燃料</td>\n<td>~10,000</td>\n<td>数百万年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>岩石圈碳酸盐</td>\n<td>&gt;60,000,000</td>\n<td>数亿年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"碳循环的主要过程\">碳循环的主要过程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"大气 CO₂&#10;    ↕ 光合作用/呼吸作用&#10;陆地生物圈&#10;    ↓ 凋落物/死亡&#10;土壤有机碳&#10;    ↓ 分解/风化&#10;溶解无机碳 → 海洋&#10;    ↓ 沉积&#10;碳酸盐岩石&#10;    ↓ 火山/变质作用（极慢）&#10;大气 CO₂\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>大气 CO₂</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↕ 光合作用/呼吸作用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>陆地生物圈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 凋落物/死亡</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>土壤有机碳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 分解/风化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>溶解无机碳 → 海洋</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 沉积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>碳酸盐岩石</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 火山/变质作用（极慢）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>大气 CO₂</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>短期碳循环</strong>（年-百年尺度）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光合作用固碳：陆地约 120 Pg C/yr，海洋约 50 Pg C/yr</li>\n<li>生物呼吸释碳：与光合固碳大致平衡</li>\n<li>土壤分解：微生物将有机碳转化为 CO₂</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>长期碳循环</strong>（千年-百万年尺度）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有机碳埋藏形成化石燃料</li>\n<li>碳酸盐沉积形成石灰岩</li>\n<li>火山活动释放深部碳</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"人类对碳循环的扰动\">人类对碳循环的扰动</h3><p>人类活动已严重打破了碳循环的自然平衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>化石燃料燃烧</strong>：每年释放约 9.5 Pg C（2023年数据）</li>\n<li><strong>土地利用变化</strong>（毁林、开垦）：每年释放约 1.1 Pg C</li>\n<li><strong>大气 CO₂ 浓度</strong>：从工业化前的 280 ppm 上升至 2024 年的约 424 ppm</li>\n<li>约 55% 的排放被海洋和陆地碳汇吸收，其余留在大气中加剧温室效应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>碳循环失衡是全球变暖的直接原因，其生态后果详见 <a href=\"../applied-ecology/climate-change-impacts\">气候变化生态效应</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"氮循环\">氮循环</h2><p>氮是蛋白质和核酸的必要组成元素，常是陆地生态系统生产力的首要限制因子。氮循环以其复杂的微生物转化过程和多种氧化态而著称。</p>\n<h3 id=\"氮的化学形态\">氮的化学形态</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>氧化态</th>\n<th>化学式</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>生物可利用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>N₂</td>\n<td>分子氮</td>\n<td>极难利用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>NH₃/NH₄⁺</td>\n<td>氨/铵</td>\n<td>可直接利用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>NO₂⁻</td>\n<td>亚硝酸盐</td>\n<td>中间产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+5</td>\n<td>NO₃⁻</td>\n<td>硝酸盐</td>\n<td>可直接利用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+1/+2</td>\n<td>N₂O/NO</td>\n<td>氧化亚氮/一氧化氮</td>\n<td>温室气体/活性气体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"氮循环的关键过程\">氮循环的关键过程</h3><p><strong>1. 固氮（Nitrogen Fixation）</strong></p>\n<p>将大气 N₂ 转化为生物可用的 NH₃：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_2 + 8H^+ + 8e^- + 16ATP → 2NH_3 + H_2 + 16ADP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>生物固氮</strong>：固氮菌（自由生活的如 Azotobacter；共生的如根瘤菌 Rhizobium）</li>\n<li><strong>闪电固氮</strong>：高温高压将 N₂ 氧化为 NOₓ</li>\n<li><strong>工业固氮</strong>：Haber-Bosch 工艺（人类每年合成约 1.5 亿吨氮肥）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 氨化（Ammonification）</strong></p>\n<p>微生物将有机氮（蛋白质、核酸中的氨基）分解释放为 NH₄⁺：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有机氮</mtext><mo>→</mo><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">有机氮 → NH_4^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有机氮</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>3. 硝化（Nitrification）</strong></p>\n<p>两步氧化过程，由自养细菌执行：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>亚硝化菌</mtext></mpadded></mover><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>硝化菌</mtext></mpadded></mover><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NH_4^+ \\xrightarrow{亚硝化菌} NO_2^- \\xrightarrow{硝化菌} NO_3^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3568em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">亚硝化菌</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3568em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">硝化菌</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>硝化产物 NO₃⁻ 易被植物吸收，但也容易随水流失（淋溶）。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 反硝化（Denitrification）</strong></p>\n<p>在缺氧条件下，反硝化细菌将 NO₃⁻ 还原为 N₂ 或 N₂O：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>→</mo><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>→</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NO_3^- → NO_2^- → NO → N_2O → N_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是氮从生态系统返回大气的主要途径，也是湿地能够净化含氮污水的生物学基础。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 厌氧氨氧化（Anammox）</strong></p>\n<p>1990 年代发现的新途径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NH_4^+ + NO_2^- → N_2 + 2H_2O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在海洋氧最低层中，anammox 贡献了高达 50% 的 N₂ 产生量，深刻改变了我们对全球氮收支的认识。这一发现展示了 <a href=\"../../../microbiology/\">微生物学</a> 新发现如何颠覆生态学的既有认知。</p>\n<h3 id=\"人类对氮循环的影响\">人类对氮循环的影响</h3><p>人类活动使全球活性氮的产生速率翻了一番以上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Haber-Bosch 工艺合成氮肥</li>\n<li>豆科作物种植面积扩大</li>\n<li>化石燃料燃烧产生 NOₓ</li>\n</ul>\n<p>后果包括：水体富营养化、死亡区（Dead Zone）、臭氧层破坏、温室气体排放、土壤酸化和生物多样性下降。</p>\n<h2 id=\"磷循环\">磷循环</h2><p>磷是 DNA、RNA、ATP 和细胞膜（磷脂）的必需成分，常是淡水生态系统生产力的首要限制因子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"磷循环的特点\">磷循环的特点</h3><p>磷循环与碳、氮循环的关键区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>无气相环节</strong>：磷不形成稳定的气态化合物，几乎完全是沉积型循环</li>\n<li><strong>循环极慢</strong>：磷的地质循环以百万年计</li>\n<li><strong>单向流失</strong>：磷从陆地流向海洋后难以快速回到陆地</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"磷循环过程\">磷循环过程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"磷酸盐岩石 → (风化) → 土壤可溶性磷酸盐&#10;    ↓                         ↕&#10;(沉积/                  植物吸收/有机磷&#10; 成岩作用)                    ↓&#10;    ↑                   动物消费&#10;    |                         ↓&#10;海洋沉积物 ← 河流径流 ← 分解释放\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>磷酸盐岩石 → (风化) → 土壤可溶性磷酸盐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓                         ↕</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(沉积/                  植物吸收/有机磷</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 成岩作用)                    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↑                   动物消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    |                         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>海洋沉积物 ← 河流径流 ← 分解释放</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"磷的限制性\">磷的限制性</h3><ul>\n<li>磷在土壤中易被铁、铝氧化物吸附固定，实际可溶性磷常极低</li>\n<li>热带风化老土（Oxisols）磷极度贫乏</li>\n<li>水体中磷浓度增高 → 藻类爆发 → 富营养化</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"磷的人类扰动\">磷的人类扰动</h3><ul>\n<li>磷矿开采与施用（全球磷矿资源有限，面临&quot;磷峰值&quot;问题）</li>\n<li>含磷洗涤剂排放</li>\n<li>畜牧业废水</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"水循环\">水循环</h2><p>水是生命的溶剂，也是物质运输的载体。水循环（Hydrological Cycle）驱动着其他所有生物地球化学循环的物质运输过程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"全球水收支\">全球水收支</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>储库</th>\n<th>储量 (10⁶ km³)</th>\n<th>占总量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>海洋</td>\n<td>1,338</td>\n<td>96.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冰川与冰盖</td>\n<td>24.1</td>\n<td>1.74%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地下水</td>\n<td>10.5</td>\n<td>0.76%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>淡水湖泊</td>\n<td>0.091</td>\n<td>0.007%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气水汽</td>\n<td>0.013</td>\n<td>0.001%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>河流</td>\n<td>0.002</td>\n<td>0.0001%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可供人类直接利用的淡水仅占全球水量的极小比例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"水循环过程\">水循环过程</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>蒸发/蒸腾</strong>：太阳能驱动水从地表和植物叶片进入大气</li>\n<li><strong>凝结与降水</strong>：水汽上升冷却形成降水返回地表</li>\n<li><strong>径流</strong>：地表径流和地下径流将水输送到海洋</li>\n<li><strong>渗透</strong>：水渗入土壤补充地下水</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"植物在水循环中的角色\">植物在水循环中的角色</h3><p>植物通过蒸腾作用将大量水分从土壤输送到大气：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>亚马逊雨林的蒸腾作用贡献了该区域约 50-75% 的降水量</li>\n<li>森林覆盖的流域比裸露流域保水能力强得多</li>\n<li>毁林导致区域降水减少、水循环加速、洪旱灾害加剧</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"硫循环\">硫循环</h2><p>硫是蛋白质（含硫氨基酸：半胱氨酸、蛋氨酸）和许多辅酶的组成成分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"硫的主要形态\">硫的主要形态</h3><ul>\n<li>SO₄²⁻（硫酸盐）：氧化态，水溶性</li>\n<li>H₂S（硫化氢）：还原态，厌氧环境</li>\n<li>DMS（二甲基硫）：海洋浮游植物产生，影响云凝结核形成</li>\n<li>SO₂（二氧化硫）：火山和化石燃料燃烧排放</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"硫循环与酸雨\">硫循环与酸雨</h3><p>化石燃料（尤其是煤）燃烧释放 SO₂ → 大气中氧化为 H₂SO₄ → 酸性沉降：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>pH &lt; 5.6 的降水被定义为酸雨</li>\n<li>导致水体酸化、森林衰退、建筑腐蚀</li>\n<li>20 世纪 80-90 年代的脱硫技术使许多地区酸雨问题明显好转</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"循环之间的耦合\">循环之间的耦合</h2><p>各元素循环并非独立运行，而是通过生物过程和化学反应紧密耦合。下图概括 C、N、P 循环如何经由分解者的分解作用汇入共用的无机养分库，并被生产者重新吸收：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  CA[大气 CO2] --&gt; P[生产者]&#10;  NA[大气 N2] --&gt;|固氮| P&#10;  PR[磷矿/土壤磷酸盐] --&gt; P&#10;  P --&gt; B[生物有机体]&#10;  B --&gt; D[分解者分解]&#10;  D --&gt; NU[无机养分库&lt;br/&gt;CO2 / NH4+ / PO43-]&#10;  NU --&gt; P&#10;  NU --&gt; CA&#10;  NU --&gt; NA\">graph TD\n  CA[大气 CO2] --&gt; P[生产者]\n  NA[大气 N2] --&gt;|固氮| P\n  PR[磷矿/土壤磷酸盐] --&gt; P\n  P --&gt; B[生物有机体]\n  B --&gt; D[分解者分解]\n  D --&gt; NU[无机养分库&lt;br/&gt;CO2 / NH4+ / PO43-]\n  NU --&gt; P\n  NU --&gt; CA\n  NU --&gt; NA</pre><h3 id=\"c-n-p-化学计量学\">C-N-P 化学计量学</h3><p><strong>Redfield 比率</strong>：海洋浮游生物体内 C:N:P ≈ 106:16:1，反映了生物对这三种元素的相对需求。当环境中某元素的供应偏离这一比率时，该元素成为限制因子。</p>\n<p>这一化学计量学原理有广泛应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>判断水体的限制养分（N:P &gt; 16 → P 限制；N:P &lt; 16 → N 限制）</li>\n<li>预测施肥对生态系统的影响</li>\n<li>理解全球变化中 C-N-P 循环的失偶联</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"氮-碳耦合\">氮-碳耦合</h3><ul>\n<li>陆地 NPP 受氮供应制约 → 氮沉降可短期增加碳固定</li>\n<li>但氮富集降低物种多样性，长期可能降低生态系统碳储存能力</li>\n<li>CO₂ 浓度升高增加植物碳固定，但可能受氮限制而无法持续</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"物质循环与能量流动的关系\">物质循环与能量流动的关系</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>能量流动</th>\n<th>物质循环</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方向</td>\n<td>单向（不可循环）</td>\n<td>循环往复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驱动力</td>\n<td>太阳能输入</td>\n<td>能量驱动转化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨系统性</td>\n<td>局限于生态系统内部</td>\n<td>跨系统、全球性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>守恒性</td>\n<td>总量递减（散热）</td>\n<td>总量守恒（形态变化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>二者相互依赖：能量流动驱动物质的转化和运输，物质为能量载体（有机物）提供构建材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人类对全球生物地球化学循环的影响\">人类对全球生物地球化学循环的影响</h2><p>人类活动已成为改变全球物质循环的主导力量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>循环</th>\n<th>主要人类扰动</th>\n<th>环境后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碳循环</td>\n<td>化石燃料燃烧、毁林</td>\n<td>全球变暖、海洋酸化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氮循环</td>\n<td>Haber-Bosch 固氮、化石燃料燃烧</td>\n<td>富营养化、N₂O 排放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磷循环</td>\n<td>磷矿开采、农业径流</td>\n<td>水体富营养化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水循环</td>\n<td>灌溉、水坝、毁林</td>\n<td>区域干旱、地下水枯竭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硫循环</td>\n<td>煤燃烧</td>\n<td>酸雨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解这些扰动及其后果是 <a href=\"../applied-ecology/conservation-biology\">保护生物学</a> 和 <a href=\"../applied-ecology/restoration-ecology\">恢复生态学</a> 制定干预措施的科学基础。同时，全球物质循环模型的构建与运行需要借助先进的计算方法，与 <a href=\"../../../systems-biology/\">系统生物学</a> 中的系统建模方法论相呼应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行星边界框架\">行星边界框架</h2><p>2009 年 Rockstrom 等人提出的<strong>行星边界</strong>（Planetary Boundaries）框架将物质循环扰动纳入全球可持续性评估：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>氮循环</strong>：已远超安全操作空间（从大气中移除 N₂ 的速率上限建议为 35 Tg N/yr，实际已达约 150 Tg N/yr）</li>\n<li><strong>磷循环</strong>：已超出安全边界</li>\n<li><strong>碳循环/气候变化</strong>：大气 CO₂ 浓度已超出 350 ppm 的建议安全边界</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些数据表明，恢复物质循环的平衡是人类社会面临的最紧迫挑战之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>物质循环是生态系统持续运转的物质基础。核心要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>物质循环具有周而复始的特征，与能量流动的单向性形成对比</li>\n<li>C、N、P 是最关键的生源元素，各有独特的循环路径和限制机制</li>\n<li>微生物是物质循环的核心驱动者，尤其在氮循环中扮演不可替代的角色</li>\n<li>各元素循环通过化学计量学和生物过程紧密耦合</li>\n<li>人类活动已从根本上改变了全球物质循环，后果深远</li>\n</ol>\n<p>至此，生态学基础章节的三个核心主题——<a href=\"ecosystem-concepts\">生态系统概念</a>、<a href=\"energy-flow-trophic-levels\">能量流动</a> 和物质循环——构成了理解所有高层次生态学现象的概念基石。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"物质循环","id":"物质循环"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"循环的基本类型","id":"循环的基本类型"},{"level":3,"text":"气体型循环（Gaseous Cycles）","id":"气体型循环-gaseous-cycles"},{"level":3,"text":"沉积型循环（Sedimentary Cycles）","id":"沉积型循环-sedimentary-cycles"},{"level":2,"text":"碳循环","id":"碳循环"},{"level":3,"text":"碳的储库与通量","id":"碳的储库与通量"},{"level":3,"text":"碳循环的主要过程","id":"碳循环的主要过程"},{"level":3,"text":"人类对碳循环的扰动","id":"人类对碳循环的扰动"},{"level":2,"text":"氮循环","id":"氮循环"},{"level":3,"text":"氮的化学形态","id":"氮的化学形态"},{"level":3,"text":"氮循环的关键过程","id":"氮循环的关键过程"},{"level":3,"text":"人类对氮循环的影响","id":"人类对氮循环的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"磷循环","id":"磷循环"},{"level":3,"text":"磷循环的特点","id":"磷循环的特点"},{"level":3,"text":"磷循环过程","id":"磷循环过程"},{"level":3,"text":"磷的限制性","id":"磷的限制性"},{"level":3,"text":"磷的人类扰动","id":"磷的人类扰动"},{"level":2,"text":"水循环","id":"水循环"},{"level":3,"text":"全球水收支","id":"全球水收支"},{"level":3,"text":"水循环过程","id":"水循环过程"},{"level":3,"text":"植物在水循环中的角色","id":"植物在水循环中的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"硫循环","id":"硫循环"},{"level":3,"text":"硫的主要形态","id":"硫的主要形态"},{"level":3,"text":"硫循环与酸雨","id":"硫循环与酸雨"},{"level":2,"text":"循环之间的耦合","id":"循环之间的耦合"},{"level":3,"text":"C-N-P 化学计量学","id":"c-n-p-化学计量学"},{"level":3,"text":"氮-碳耦合","id":"氮-碳耦合"},{"level":3,"text":"物质循环与能量流动的关系","id":"物质循环与能量流动的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"人类对全球生物地球化学循环的影响","id":"人类对全球生物地球化学循环的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"行星边界框架","id":"行星边界框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"能量流动与营养级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ecology/foundations/energy-flow-trophic-levels"},"next":{"title":"种群动态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ecology/population-ecology/population-dynamics"}}